# Interview Me

{%- include "templates/.harness/skills-shared/objective-control/CONTROL." ~ harness_language ~ ".md.jinja" %}

State the tentative objective and unresolved edge before each question. Ask one question at a time, with your best evidence-backed guess and the concrete plan difference its answer causes. Ask now only for `CRITICAL_BLOCK` or `HIGH_FIX_NOW`; log every other candidate as `DEFER_RUN` without consuming user attention.

Stop once objective, users, success state, binding constraints, and critical-path decisions are explicit enough to predict the user's answer with high confidence. Restate the resulting `START` and `GOAL` for confirmation.
